#### brute force (timeout)

```js
const intersection = (a, b) => {
  const result = [];
  for (let item of b) {
    if (a.includes(item)) {
      result.push(item);
    }
  }
  return result;
};
```

+ n = length of array a, m = length of array b
+ Time: O(n*m)
+ Space: O(min(n,m))



